      647         VIEW-AS TEXT
      648        SIZE 23.63 BY .67 NO-UNDO.
      649   DEFINE VARIABLE fi-free AS DECIMAL FORMAT "->>>,>>>,>>9.999":U INITIAL 0
      650        LABEL "Свободно"
